          "similarity_score": 0.2840892,
          "dense_rank": 22,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What should I do if my insurance isn't listed or I am out-of-network?\nAnswer: You can pay out-of-pocket for your visit, and we can provide you with an itemized receipt to submit to your insu",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 37,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.2834615,
          "dense_rank": 23,
          "lexical_score": 1.4258405,
          "lexical_rank": 19,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# General practice services\n## Medical examinations for work, driving and sport\n\nWe do not carry out commercial driver (DOT) medical examinations, pilot medicals or immigration medical examinations. A",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 25,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.2815888,
          "dense_rank": 24,
          "lexical_score": 1.4551051,
          "lexical_rank": 17,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: How much will my visit cost if I am paying out-of-pocket?\nAnswer: Out-of-pocket rates are $120 for a General Practitioner (GP) visit, $180 for a Dentist appointment, and $160 for all other s",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 23,
