          "similarity_score": 0.27273557,
          "dense_rank": 25,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Which health insurance plans do you accept?\nAnswer: We accept most major insurance providers, including Blue Cross Blue Shield, Aetna, Cigna, UnitedHealthcare, and Medicare. If you're unsure",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 31,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": null,
          "dense_rank": null,
          "lexical_score": 5.859711,
          "lexical_rank": 2,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Preparing for tests at the clinic\n## Urine sample\n\nIf you have been asked to bring a urine sample, collect a sterile container from the front desk beforehand; household containers can contaminate the sample. Unless you were told otherwise, collect the first urine of the morning, catching the middle part of the stream. Write your full name and date of birth on the label. Bring the sample to the clinic within 2 hours. If that is not possible, keep it in the fridge - not the freezer - for up to 24 hours.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 30,
